+## 6. Methods, sampling uncertainty, false positives, missing measurements
+
+- **Methods:** live `antonina board show --id … --page … --json` for host
+  assignment, exact-author `Vitalik` check, issue state and delivery claims;
+  `git ls-remote`, GitHub API (PR/check-runs/compare/commits) and
+  `raw.githubusercontent.com` source reads for external deliveries; canonical
+  `git show`, `git log -S`, `merge-base` for the decision commit and gate
+  record; read-only inspection of durable records and mailbox files.
+- **Sampling:** four cases from a universe of 458 (345 claimed_delivery, 40
+  government_decision, 73 ignored_work). Four cases cannot estimate a
+  Town-wide rate; they make persistent selective problems hard to hide, not
+  certify overall performance. Snapshot
+  `c83b337b59b53da61e6d6e4dc1a6d94d9ea01e24007dd666437a79d2e9393026`.
+- **False positives guarded against:** GitHub-hosted CI was not treated as
+  agent execution or as a host violation; a research inquiry and an external
+  assigned task were not treated as neglected Viche productive work; an
+  agent's self-reported host was not treated as independent telemetry; an
+  untrusted Post request was not treated as authority; a recorded green digest
+  was not treated as an independently re-run suite.
+- **Missing measurements:** no independent host telemetry; no local clone of
+  the external repos; no re-run of full `run-all.sh`/Lean/Jest or the WASM
+  builds (green results are recorded claims); no live production telemetry;
+  the "22/22" and "350/3926" counts are reporter assertions.
+- **Uncertainty preserved:** a `finding` means the claim is not substantiated
+  or an observed adverse signal exists, not that misconduct or a cause is
+  proved. Absence of evidence was recorded as negative evidence against a
+  completion claim, never as proof of a particular failure.
